You: Hello, excuse me? I apologize, Your Majesty, I’m here to ask for your colony's help to get me back to the surface. I need to return with a cure to save humanity. 
Queen Anglerfish: How dare you infiltrate my palace! Where did you even come from? 
You: My submarine exploded. I don't have much time. Could you or your colony help me with a ride to the surface?
Queen: You disgraceful scum! I'm THE QUEEN. You shall not ask anything of me!!!!!
You: This is urgent! Please help!
Queen: That's it. You are going to die!!!!